From: relay12 contributors
Subject: [PATCH] dtl: replace MSVC-only _com_error

Carry HRESULT values in relay12's dependency-free exception type. The
replacement preserves every existing throw value, including the two S_OK
control-flow sentinels, and leaves all catch boundaries in place.
---
diff --git a/include/D3D12TranslationLayerDependencyIncludes.h b/include/D3D12TranslationLayerDependencyIncludes.h
index 1869744..9d940af 100644
--- a/include/D3D12TranslationLayerDependencyIncludes.h
+++ b/include/D3D12TranslationLayerDependencyIncludes.h
@@ -14,6 +14,7 @@
 #define WIN32_LEAN_AND_MEAN
 #include <windows.h>
 #include "relay_atl_compat.hpp"
+#include "relay_hresult_error.hpp"
 #include <comdef.h>
 #include <strsafe.h>
 
